%% DuckDB Query Data Flow
%% Commit: 52a07d06eafb63b60ed6275a494b85f93be4b986

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Parser
    participant Binder
    participant Optimizer
    participant Executor
    participant Pipeline
    participant Storage
    participant Buffer

    Client->>Parser: SQL Query
    Note over Parser: libpg_query generates AST

    Parser->>Binder: ParsedStatement
    Note over Binder: Resolve names, check types

    Binder->>Optimizer: LogicalPlan
    Note over Optimizer: Apply optimization rules:<br/>1. Filter Pushdown<br/>2. Column Pruning<br/>3. Join Ordering<br/>4. Statistics Propagation

    Optimizer->>Executor: OptimizedPlan
    Note over Executor: Convert to physical plan

    Executor->>Pipeline: Build Pipelines
    Note over Pipeline: Identify parallelism opportunities

    loop For each Pipeline
        Pipeline->>Storage: Request Data
        Storage->>Buffer: Pin Blocks

        loop For each Morsel (2048 rows)
            Buffer->>Pipeline: DataChunk
            Note over Pipeline: Vectorized execution:<br/>Filter, Project, Join, Aggregate
        end

        Pipeline->>Executor: Results
    end

    Executor->>Client: QueryResult
    Note over Client: Iterate over results

    Note over Buffer: Unpin blocks (LRU eviction)
